SECTION      | KEY            | VALUE
-------------+---------------+---------------------------
META         | project_id    | cataclysm-hq
META         | version       | 1.0
META         | author        | opencode agent
META         | entry_layout  | projects/cataclysm-hq/layouts/main.chtpm
META         | engine        | tpmos

STATE        | starting_map  | dng_0001
STATE        | player_piece  | hero
STATE        | current_world | cataclysm
STATE        | current_map   | dng_0001
STATE        | turn          | 0
STATE        | game_over     | false

# Book:Page integration - each METHOD maps to an .asm event script
# Gemma API can generate new scripts here, validated by promotion ledger

METHOD       | game_loop     | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/game_loop.asm
METHOD       | move          | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/move.asm
METHOD       | combat        | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/combat.asm
METHOD       | look          | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/look.asm
METHOD       | pickup        | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/pickup.asm
METHOD       | inventory     | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/inventory.asm
METHOD       | rest          | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/rest.asm
METHOD       | descend       | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/descent.asm
METHOD       | die           | projects/cataclysm-hq/scripts/death.asm

# Concept Bank integration - game concepts tracked for self-building
# Gemma proposes weight deltas on these slots; validator enforces bounds
CONCEPT      | combat        | type=master
CONCEPT      | exploration   | type=master
CONCEPT      | survival      | type=master
CONCEPT      | magic         | type=master
CONCEPT      | stealth       | type=master
CONCEPT      | crafting      | type=master
CONCEPT      | hunger        | type=spoke | points_to=survival | weight=0.60
CONCEPT      | weapon_combat | type=spoke | points_to=combat | weight=0.85
CONCEPT      | potion_use    | type=spoke | points_to=magic | weight=0.40

# Gemma's learning tier (per A-TEARIT bootstrap)
TUNE         | max_tier      | preschool

RESPONSE     | default       | Cataclysm-HQ: a procedural ASCII roguelike on TPMOS events.
RESPONSE     | on_load       | Welcome, adventurer. Descending into the dungeon...
